<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sears estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sears estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said its analyst Ed Weller raised his earnings estimates for Sears, Roebuck &amp; Co based on accounting changes.</p>
<p>-- He raised his 1997 estimate to $3.92 a share from $3.64 and 1998 to $4.45 a share from $4.34.</p>
<p>-- Weller maintains a buy rating on the stock.</p>
</text>
